# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Python API for the latest version of Qiskit Fermions"
msgstr "Pasang API Python untuk versi terkini Qiskit Fermions"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Python API"
msgstr "Pasang API Python"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Python API {#install-the-python-api}"
msgstr "Pasang API Python {#install-the-python-api}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prasyarat {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. Use [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Pertama, cipta persekitaran minimum yang hanya mempunyai Python dipasang di dalamnya. Gunakan [persekitaran maya Python](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktifkan persekitaran baharu anda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package: from PyPI or from source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "Terdapat dua cara utama untuk memasang pakej ini: daripada PyPI atau daripada sumber. Kaedah yang diutamakan ialah memasang daripada PyPI:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Pasang daripada PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Pasang daripada sumber {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository you should install from source.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda bercadang untuk membangun dalam repositori, anda harus memasang daripada sumber.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, Qiskit must be installed in the same Python environment that you install `qiskit-fermions` in. The simplest way to do this is from PyPI, but you can install Qiskit from source if you want to.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, Qiskit mesti dipasang dalam persekitaran Python yang sama tempat anda memasang `qiskit-fermions`. Cara paling mudah ialah daripada PyPI, tetapi anda boleh memasang Qiskit daripada sumber jika anda mahu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, clone the `qiskit-fermions` repository.\n"
msgstr "Seterusnya, klon repositori `qiskit-fermions`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now, install the Rust toolchain, upgrade pip, and enter the repository. Refer to the [Rust documentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) for instructions on installing the toolchain.\n"
msgstr "Sekarang, pasang rantai alat Rust, naik taraf pip, dan masuk ke dalam repositori. Rujuk [dokumentasi Rust](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) untuk arahan memasang rantai alat tersebut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the remaining `build` dependencies. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Pasang kebergantungan `build` yang selebihnya. Jika anda bercadang untuk membangun dalam repositori, pasang kebergantungan `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-fermions` to the virtual environment.\n"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya ialah memasang `qiskit-fermions` ke dalam persekitaran maya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Hint\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Petunjuk\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can also perform an editable install while still compiling the underlying Rust crate in `release` mode:\n"
msgstr "  Anda juga boleh melakukan pemasangan boleh edit sambil masih mengkompil crate Rust asas dalam mod `release`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Some features rely on optional dependencies. To install all of them, use the `all` extra:\n"
msgstr "  Sesetengah ciri bergantung pada kebergantungan pilihan. Untuk memasang kesemuanya, gunakan extra `all`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Refer to the `[project.optional-dependencies]` section of [pyproject.toml](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fermions/blob/main/pyproject.toml) to see which dependency groups are available.\n"
msgstr "  Rujuk bahagian `[project.optional-dependencies]` dalam [pyproject.toml](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fermions/blob/main/pyproject.toml) untuk melihat kumpulan kebergantungan yang tersedia.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can optionally verify that the installation was successful. The simplest test is to try and import one of the classes provided by the `qiskit-fermions` package, as in the following example:\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh mengesahkan secara pilihan bahawa pemasangan berjaya. Ujian paling mudah ialah cuba mengimport salah satu kelas yang disediakan oleh pakej `qiskit-fermions`, seperti dalam contoh berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If this completes successfully, your installation worked.\n"
msgstr "Jika ini selesai dengan jayanya, pemasangan anda berfungsi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can also run the entire Python test suite:\n"
msgstr "  Anda juga boleh menjalankan keseluruhan set ujian Python:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  To additionally run the tests that exercise optional dependencies, install the extras and use the `testoptional` target:\n"
msgstr "  Untuk turut menjalankan ujian yang menggunakan kebergantungan pilihan, pasang extra dan gunakan sasaran `testoptional`:\n"
